        "steam_appid": 3738820,
        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738820/extras/55fdb1f0be851956ec6a8fabf0439cfa.avif?t=1758048638\" width=300 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overview</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Nonogram Nonsense</i>] is a pure logic puzzle game for players who crave challenge without clutter. Solve procedurally generated nonogram puzzles — number-based logic grids that reveal abstract patterns, not images.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>Puzzle of the Day</strong> and <strong>Endless  Generation</strong>, there’s always something new to solve. Clean, minimal design keeps the focus where it belongs: on the puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 Puzzle of the Day – A new random puzzle seeded daily</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♾️ Unlimited Puzzles – Generate and solve endlessly</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚙️ Smart Generation – Always solvable with logic, never guesswork</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 Accessible Design – Straightforward interface with no clutter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💾 Mid-Game Save – Pause and resume puzzles anytime</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⏱️ Optional Timer – For those who enjoy racing the clock</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 Focused Game-play – Minimal menus, no ads, no micro-transactions</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738820/extras/55fdb1f0be851956ec6a8fabf0439cfa.avif?t=1758048638\" width=300 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overview</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Nonogram Nonsense</i>] is a pure logic puzzle game for players who crave challenge without clutter. Solve procedurally generated nonogram puzzles — number-based logic grids that reveal abstract patterns, not images.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>Puzzle of the Day</strong> and <strong>Endless  Generation</strong>, there’s always something new to solve. Clean, minimal design keeps the focus where it belongs: on the puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 Puzzle of the Day – A new random puzzle seeded daily</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♾️ Unlimited Puzzles – Generate and solve endlessly</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚙️ Smart Generation – Always solvable with logic, never guesswork</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 Accessible Design – Straightforward interface with no clutter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💾 Mid-Game Save – Pause and resume puzzles anytime</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⏱️ Optional Timer – For those who enjoy racing the clock</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 Focused Game-play – Minimal menus, no ads, no micro-transactions</p>",
