        "supported_languages": "English",
        "reviews": "“But my favorite part is the endless puzzle generation, where you can set the size and dimensions. I’ve yet to hit a puzzle that was unfair or required guessing. Everything is 100% solvable, which speaks volumes about the smart algorithm the developer created. Also, a huge shoutout for the mid-game saving and load function.”<br>5 – Puzzle Lovers<br>",
        "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738820/f9f2bc77675960c734a52aa35519f79b5db7ac61/header.jpg?t=1758048638",
